meta {
  name: 01 Home
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/patient-portal/home
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{patientAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Composed home-summary for the patient portal, scoped to the session's patient +
  tenant (from the patient JWT). Read-only; best-effort (a thin/absent source
  yields a zero/empty value rather than failing the page).

  Response `data`:
  - `patient`: `{ patientId, name, initials, platformMrn, photoUrl, tenantId, tenantName }`
  - `stats`: `{ upcomingAppointments, reportsReady, unreadMessages, balanceDue, billsCount }`
    (`balanceDue` is whole rupees; `unreadMessages` is `0` until a patient inbox exists)
  - `nextAppointment`: `{ orderCode, appointmentAt, appointmentType, doctorName, branchName, reason, status }` or `null`
  - `reportsReady`: up to 5 `{ id, testName, orderCode, publishedAt }` (PUBLISHED reports)
  - `recentMessages`: `[]` (no patient inbox model yet)

  Requires a patient JWT; on a temp-password session returns `403
  PATIENT_PASSWORD_CHANGE_REQUIRED`.
}
